  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facility for Oil Sector Transformation II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance management of Nigeria&#x2019;s resources from extractive industries through prevention of revenue losses, strengthening management, transparency and accountability of extractive industries and improving policy outcomes for local communities affected by extractive industries. From 1 July 2021 activities will focus on climate mitigation in the extractives sector.</narrative>
  </description>
